322
19:08.492 --> 19:10.715
I had no idea you were such a flirt.

323
19:10.740 --> 19:11.729
That's an understatement.

324
19:11.993 --> 19:14.154
He's got a lot more game than you think.

325
19:15.034 --> 19:16.640
I just learned it from TikTok.

326
19:17.747 --> 19:19.256
I think one of these VIPs

327
19:19.281 --> 19:21.294
might be one of the Black Bull gang's higher-ups.

328
19:23.667 --> 19:25.601
So we have to do whatever it takes

329
19:26.089 --> 19:27.763
to get those higher-ups to pick us.

330
19:27.961 --> 19:29.276
So that means...

331
19:29.634 --> 19:31.483
we have to go undercover as hosts.

332
19:31.648 --> 19:34.588
None of us know how to do that, though.

333
19:37.561 --> 19:38.409
I know someone...

334
19:38.612 --> 19:39.927
who could train us.

335
19:42.060 --> 19:45.702
Welcome, everyone, to...

336
19:46.252 --> 19:47.887
Host Training...

337
19:48.400 --> 19:50.698
(Host Training 101) 101.

338
19:51.034 --> 19:54.765
With over 30 years of experience in host bars,

339
19:54.827 --> 19:57.636
I'm here to teach you all about being a host

340
19:57.668 --> 20:00.397
and how to land a client.

341
20:05.690 --> 20:08.343
(Black Bull Agent Party)

342
20:15.133 --> 20:16.416
You look like an anime character.

343
20:16.787 --> 20:18.543
We had to change up our looks, didn't we?

344
20:18.654 --> 20:19.827
Do you see those guys?

345
20:19.920 --> 20:22.080
They're on our most-wanted list.

346
20:22.980 --> 20:25.340
We need to find enough evidence to take them down.

347
20:26.760 --> 20:27.875
Understood.

348
20:28.244 --> 20:29.940
Tonight, I'm going all out

349
20:30.913 --> 20:32.260
for the sake of our mission.

350
20:33.420 --> 20:33.821
Let's do this.

351
20:33.846 --> 20:35.540
Let's start with the first rule.

352
20:35.571 --> 20:37.969
It's all about eye contact.

353
20:37.994 --> 20:38.660
(1. Eye Contact)

354
20:38.685 --> 20:40.372
Imagine...

355
20:40.634 --> 20:43.967
the person in front of you is a client.

356
20:44.467 --> 20:47.860
You should be thinking, "I'm handsome,"

357
20:48.214 --> 20:49.853
or, "Pick me."

358
20:50.753 --> 20:51.863
Are you sleepy, Captain?

359
20:53.079 --> 20:53.712
No.

360
20:53.818 --> 20:54.599
Seductive.

361
20:54.994 --> 20:56.247
Hello.

362
20:56.818 --> 20:58.059
What's your name?

363
20:58.100 --> 21:00.479
Use your eyes to charm them.

364
21:00.714 --> 21:02.302
Look into their eyes.

365
21:02.446 --> 21:04.140
You'll love my service.

366
21:06.213 --> 21:06.940
Oh...

367
21:08.814 --> 21:09.627
Are you okay?

368
21:11.240 --> 21:12.400
I'm fine.

369
21:17.440 --> 21:19.040
Isn't that a bit much already?

370
21:20.053 --> 21:21.393
You're going to be picked all night long.

371
21:21.418 --> 21:22.993
Hey, we're here to work.

372
21:23.234 --> 21:24.573
You can't be getting jealous of me.

373
21:25.359 --> 21:27.840
Come on, I'm all yours anyway.

374
21:29.627 --> 21:31.700
Let's move on to the second rule,

375
21:31.754 --> 21:33.008
and that is...

376
21:33.338 --> 21:34.610
(2. The Smile) the smile, of course.

377
21:36.093 --> 21:37.023
That's it!

378
21:37.427 --> 21:39.010
Look, look at him.

379
21:39.153 --> 21:40.372
Just like this smile.

380
21:40.440 --> 21:42.093
This is exactly how a good host smiles.

381
21:42.226 --> 21:43.311
Now, you give it a try.

382
21:45.313 --> 21:46.440
No way. That's a no.

383
21:46.465 --> 21:47.819
Both your eyes and your smile.

384
21:47.844 --> 21:48.740
You're literally shaking.

385
21:48.778 --> 21:49.678
Now, you two.

386
21:49.988 --> 21:51.391
Start with the eye contact.

387
21:52.045 --> 21:55.245
Now give a gentle, slight smirk.

388
22:01.573 --> 22:02.373
Hey...

389
22:03.022 --> 22:04.576
Are you guys for real?

390
22:05.260 --> 22:06.716
I just did what you told us to.

391
22:20.886 --> 22:21.689
Wanna come with me?

392
22:21.714 --> 22:22.774
I asked if you wanna come with me.

393
22:22.799 --> 22:23.409
No, thanks.

394
22:23.434 --> 22:24.295
No? Come on.

395
22:24.320 --> 22:25.196
Hey, North.

396
22:27.707 --> 22:28.836
What's up, Mungkorn?

397
22:29.270 --> 22:30.867
I thought you weren't going to show up.

398
22:31.153 --> 22:32.536
How could I not?

399
22:32.847 --> 22:34.770
We barely talked last time.

400
22:34.861 --> 22:36.144
This is my husband.

401
22:36.573 --> 22:37.980
His name is...

402
22:38.025 --> 22:39.086
I'm Hunglay.

403
22:40.336 --> 22:42.417
Glad to see you again.

404
22:43.520 --> 22:45.290
Let's move on to the third rule.

405
22:45.315 --> 22:46.980
This is the most important one

406
22:47.005 --> 22:48.298
because this...

407
22:48.323 --> 22:51.612
is how we'll infiltrate the Black Bull gang.

408
22:51.867 --> 22:54.818
It's all about the touch.

409
22:54.843 --> 22:55.618
(3. Touch)

410
22:57.107 --> 23:00.654
Sorry for being too serious last time.

411
23:03.500 --> 23:05.520
Let's start the practice session.

412
23:06.574 --> 23:07.374
Look.

413
23:07.700 --> 23:08.647
Flash a smile.

414
23:08.672 --> 23:09.534
Correct.

415
23:09.653 --> 23:10.674
Closer.

416
23:11.060 --> 23:12.787
Make the client's heart race.

417
23:12.872 --> 23:14.327
- Does it have to be this close? - "Hello."

418
23:14.706 --> 23:16.234
- "Hi." - Excuse me.

419
23:18.547 --> 23:20.063
- I think this is too close. - Cut!

420
23:20.107 --> 23:21.663
You did a great job.

421
23:23.533 --> 23:25.117
Let's move to this couple.

422
23:25.300 --> 23:26.950
It's finally our turn.

423
23:28.334 --> 23:30.334
I'm quite a pro at the whole touching thing.

424
24:15.353 --> 24:16.343
Let's stop it here.

425
24:18.346 --> 24:19.936
I think I've got the hang of it.

426
24:20.306 --> 24:21.648
Great!

427
24:21.949 --> 24:22.653
Good job.

428
24:22.670 --> 24:24.156
You've earned 100 drinks!

429
24:24.160 --> 24:25.235
Just like that!

430
24:25.240 --> 24:29.651
And that is the complete course for Host Training 101.

431
24:29.776 --> 24:32.923
Now you're all ready to hunt.

432
24:39.292 --> 24:41.892
Are we all going to be hosts together?

433
24:42.127 --> 24:44.260
No. It'll just be me and Mungkorn.

434
24:44.347 --> 24:44.956
What?

435
24:45.800 --> 24:47.483
Then why the hell did you make me do all this?

436
24:56.100 --> 24:57.980
I want to try being a host, too.

437
24:58.360 --> 25:01.060
Being stuck on lookout duty with you isn't exciting at all.

438
25:01.520 --> 25:02.970
If you want some excitement, you're free to leave.

439
25:03.080 --> 25:04.040
I'm not stopping you.

440
25:04.150 --> 25:04.920
Nah.

441
25:05.170 --> 25:06.440
I don't want to leave you by yourself,

442
25:06.650 --> 25:07.680
or you'll get lonely.

443
25:09.190 --> 25:10.280
I won't be lonely.

444
25:11.080 --> 25:12.710
If anything, I'd actually be relieved.

445
25:13.680 --> 25:14.950
Give it a rest.

446
25:15.370 --> 25:16.540
Do you find me annoying?

447
25:17.720 --> 25:18.860
Or are you afraid that...

448
25:19.380 --> 25:21.360
you won't be able to resist if we're too close,

449
25:21.730 --> 25:22.840
so you're shooing me away?

450
25:23.450 --> 25:25.230
I know my charm is irresistible.

451
25:28.490 --> 25:30.610
I admire your optimism, Captain.

452
25:38.260 --> 25:39.490
That red hair of yours...

453
25:40.090 --> 25:41.020
I like it.

454
25:41.850 --> 25:46.340
Since you're here with your husband, what am I supposed to do?

455
25:46.690 --> 25:47.650
It's fine.

456
25:48.330 --> 25:50.820
We're in an open relationship.

457
25:51.770 --> 25:53.360
We just go out to have some fun...

458
25:54.560 --> 25:56.110
and come back to each other.

459
25:58.590 --> 25:59.340
Got it.

460
25:59.710 --> 26:01.380
An open relationship sounds nice.

461
26:01.670 --> 26:02.640
So...

462
26:05.370 --> 26:07.000
no jealousy tonight, then?

463
26:13.770 --> 26:14.980
Not at all.

464
26:15.750 --> 26:17.743
Mungkorn likes a bit of a thrill.

465
26:18.870 --> 26:19.840
Let's have a toast.

466
26:39.360 --> 26:41.480
By the way, who's that?

467
26:42.880 --> 26:44.390
He's been staring at us for a while.

468
26:45.980 --> 26:47.540
That's Mr. Tiannan,

469
26:47.730 --> 26:50.610
an ultra-VIP that we have to land.

470
26:51.010 --> 26:53.680
If anyone manages to close the deal with him, they're set.

471
26:54.040 --> 26:56.620
He's got plenty of resources to keep the party going.

472
26:57.260 --> 26:58.290
Make sure you look good.

473
27:07.590 --> 27:09.630
Hey, one of the guests wants to speak with you.

474
27:09.880 --> 27:10.990
Two of you, actually.

475
27:14.350 --> 27:15.570
Let's go, Mungkorn.

476
27:17.220 --> 27:18.360
Not you, though.

477
27:19.150 --> 27:20.250
He wants these two.

478
27:45.980 --> 27:46.930
Open the door.

479
27:47.520 --> 27:48.800
Open the door!

480
27:50.550 --> 27:51.980
I said open the damn door!

481
27:52.940 --> 27:54.370
- Kiss me. - I said open up!

482
27:54.400 --> 27:55.200
Kiss me.

483
27:55.450 --> 27:57.250
- What? - I said kiss me.

484
28:05.500 --> 28:06.160
Whoa!

485
28:06.420 --> 28:07.450
What the hell are you doing?

486
28:09.000 --> 28:11.520
Oh, I just felt like the mood was right,

487
28:11.550 --> 28:13.470
so we just pulled over and got to it right here.

488
28:14.050 --> 28:15.030
You can't do that.

489
28:15.200 --> 28:16.480
This is private property,

490
28:16.630 --> 28:18.090
and they're having a party inside.

491
28:18.190 --> 28:19.130
I see.

492
28:19.150 --> 28:22.140
Look, go straight for 2 kilometers and you'll find a hotel.

493
28:22.280 --> 28:23.990
Go get a room. Now!

494
28:24.560 --> 28:26.610
My boyfriend likes it outdoors.

495
28:27.760 --> 28:29.150
But not here.

496
28:29.260 --> 28:30.660
Go do it somewhere else. Leave now!

497
28:32.010 --> 28:32.810
Got it.

498
28:34.410 --> 28:35.940
Hey, nothing to see here!

499
28:58.750 --> 28:59.690
What are you looking at?

500
29:18.630 --> 29:19.600
Where are you guys from?

501
29:20.520 --> 29:21.850
How come I've never seen you before?

502
29:25.120 --> 29:27.220
I'm from Lampang.

503
29:27.420 --> 29:29.760
As for my partner...

504
29:30.060 --> 29:32.850
he's from Mae Hong Son.

505
29:33.890 --> 29:34.900
You're a couple?

506
29:36.140 --> 29:37.390
How did you two meet?

507
29:38.760 --> 29:40.080
We met at a police station.

508
29:42.800 --> 29:44.290
Well, that day...

509
29:44.500 --> 29:46.910
I got drug-tested and tested positive,

510
29:47.830 --> 29:49.510
and I happened to run into him.

511
29:49.590 --> 29:51.220
Same charge and everything.

512
29:51.270 --> 29:52.420
I thought it was fate.

513
29:54.940 --> 29:55.600
Good.

514
29:56.320 --> 29:57.660
I've got something special for you.

515
30:01.490 --> 30:03.040
I'm Tiannan.

516
30:08.620 --> 30:11.280
I'm Hunglay.

517
30:12.230 --> 30:13.910
My partner is...

518
30:14.450 --> 30:15.550
Dragon.

519
30:19.060 --> 30:21.140
You're letting him answer everything?

520
30:21.540 --> 30:22.550
Can't you talk?

521
30:25.610 --> 30:26.810
I can.

522
30:28.100 --> 30:29.850
I'm just feeling a bit shy right now.

523
30:30.760 --> 30:33.980
Actually, you're exactly my type.

524
30:37.320 --> 30:38.990
You're my type, too.

525
30:40.490 --> 30:41.330
Petite.

526
30:42.140 --> 30:43.010
Easy to pick up.

527
30:44.620 --> 30:45.420
Tonight...

528
30:46.540 --> 30:48.430
we're going to have some fun.

529
30:57.710 --> 31:00.780
What are you going to do to us?

530
31:01.470 --> 31:02.900
I'm dying with excitement.

531
31:05.100 --> 31:05.850
You're excited?

532
31:05.900 --> 31:06.880
How about some treats?

533
31:07.840 --> 31:10.320
It helps you feel more relaxed.

534
31:22.380 --> 31:23.090
Treats.

535
31:25.762 --> 31:27.020
Let's have some, shall we?

536
31:29.310 --> 31:30.850
Eat up.

537
31:47.180 --> 31:48.850
I wanted another piece.

538
31:50.260 --> 31:53.400
Well, he just had some last night.

539
31:53.420 --> 31:56.040
He's still feeling the buzz.

540
31:57.190 --> 31:58.000
Okay.

541
31:58.700 --> 32:00.260
You really love your partner, huh?

542
32:01.120 --> 32:02.000
Not bad.

543
32:02.280 --> 32:05.050
I don't know if those two will be too much for you, though.

544
32:05.810 --> 32:06.810
You know,

545
32:07.710 --> 32:09.170
in the next 15 minutes,

546
32:09.990 --> 32:13.010
we're going to take a trip to Fantasyland.

547
32:19.440 --> 32:21.150
Don't you worry about it.

548
32:21.840 --> 32:22.900
I mean...

549
32:24.270 --> 32:26.790
I'm dying to take you with me.

550
32:36.230 --> 32:37.730
Now that's what I'm talking about.

551
32:37.970 --> 32:40.180
My radar told me to pick you, and it was right.

552
32:41.750 --> 32:43.640
Let's get ready to explore Fantasyland with me.

553
32:44.040 --> 32:45.460
Tell me where you want to go.

554
32:46.010 --> 32:48.120
I've got a VVIP passport right here.

555
32:48.150 --> 32:49.510
Whoa, that's firm.

556
32:49.520 --> 32:50.600
Very firm.

557
33:03.790 --> 33:04.460
Wine, sir.

558
33:06.180 --> 33:07.070
Thank you.

559
33:07.940 --> 33:08.840
You're cute.

560
33:09.410 --> 33:10.410
Want to sit with me?

561
33:11.580 --> 33:12.650
No, thank you.

562
33:12.680 --> 33:14.990
I'm on staff. I have to get back to work.

563
33:15.280 --> 33:16.660
With your looks,

564
33:17.070 --> 33:18.220
why don't you work for me?

565
33:18.573 --> 33:21.123
I'll make sure you get rich.

566
33:22.830 --> 33:23.810
I'm good, sir.

567
33:24.040 --> 33:25.390
I'm not ready to be rich yet.

568
33:28.190 --> 33:28.910
Hey.

569
33:31.880 --> 33:33.290
With a face like yours,

570
33:34.480 --> 33:36.550
one cheek pinch could earn you a thousand.

571
33:37.560 --> 33:39.650
In one night, you'd make a hundred thousand.

572
33:42.280 --> 33:42.930
Hey!

573
33:43.810 --> 33:44.610
What are you doing?

574
33:46.800 --> 33:48.440
No one touches my boyfriend's cheeks.

575
33:49.980 --> 33:51.690
Wait, he's also taken?

576
33:51.790 --> 33:52.580
Yeah.

577
33:53.310 --> 33:55.420
Only I get to touch his cheeks.

578
34:00.100 --> 34:00.990
We're really sorry.

579
34:05.860 --> 34:06.670
Phuwin,

580
34:06.940 --> 34:09.290
you can't be jealous like this. We're on duty.

581
34:09.740 --> 34:11.160
But he was going to touch your cheek.

582
34:11.583 --> 34:13.400
I don't like it. I'm jealous.

583
34:14.460 --> 34:15.690
You're acting suspicious.

584
34:16.150 --> 34:17.260
You're going to get us caught.

585
34:17.730 --> 34:18.950
Keep your cool, Phuwin.

586
34:20.236 --> 34:21.890
Then you'd better stop being so cute

587
34:22.280 --> 34:23.310
so I won't get jealous.

588
34:27.780 --> 34:29.660
Come on, get back to work.

589
35:01.050 --> 35:02.260
Hunglay, are you okay?

590
35:03.670 --> 35:04.870
I'm fine.

591
35:05.690 --> 35:07.410
These drugs can't affect me.

592
36:06.480 --> 36:10.080
I'm ready for the two of you to serve me now.

593
36:10.720 --> 36:11.900
Let me see...

594
36:12.520 --> 36:13.540
what special moves you've got.

595
36:14.830 --> 36:16.750
I'm going to make sure...

596
36:18.230 --> 36:20.330
you never forget this night.

597
36:23.050 --> 36:25.080
I promise I've got more moves...

598
36:26.783 --> 36:29.793
than you'd see in any dance class.

599
36:49.170 --> 36:50.980
Anyway,

600
36:51.060 --> 36:54.410
how about we do something to stimulate the mood?

601
36:55.280 --> 36:56.290
Stimulate?

602
36:56.530 --> 36:57.470
Stimulate what?

603
36:58.210 --> 36:59.940
Well, we are going to...

604
37:00.683 --> 37:05.870
give you a four-hand massage.

605
37:08.020 --> 37:09.110
That sounds good.

606
37:09.390 --> 37:10.890
I'm really stiff right now.

607
37:11.206 --> 37:12.426
If we do it right away,

608
37:12.762 --> 37:14.412
it won't be exciting.

609
37:14.980 --> 37:16.970
Let's take our time,

610
37:18.089 --> 37:19.830
nice and slow.

611
37:22.813 --> 37:23.723
Does this feel good?

612
37:24.220 --> 37:25.290
Yeah.

613
37:26.970 --> 37:27.900
Wow.

614
37:29.886 --> 37:32.560
Would you mind if I adjusted the frequency?

615
37:38.730 --> 37:40.220
The frequency is already set.

616
37:41.260 --> 37:43.420
I need to tune the other side, too.

617
37:51.970 --> 37:52.830
Tiannan...

618
37:53.590 --> 37:54.140
What?

619
37:54.270 --> 37:57.630
I think you should take a shower first.

620
37:58.570 --> 38:00.950
So the massage will be smooth,

621
38:01.476 --> 38:03.620
and you'll feel more relaxed.

622
38:05.370 --> 38:07.020
But I've already showered.

623
38:09.070 --> 38:11.100
We need to apply massage oil, though.

624
38:11.640 --> 38:13.520
We'll apply it all over your body.

625
38:13.550 --> 38:15.050
Oh, okay. Oil...

626
38:15.120 --> 38:15.960
Got it.

627
38:16.510 --> 38:17.900
Apply it to every part of me.

628
38:17.920 --> 38:18.890
Of course.

629
38:18.920 --> 38:20.020
- Every single part? - Yeah.

630
38:22.320 --> 38:23.710
I'll walk you to the bathroom.

631
38:23.730 --> 38:25.430
Make sure you clean yourself thoroughly.

632
38:25.470 --> 38:27.180
I'll be waiting for you.

633
38:40.390 --> 38:41.720
Keep a lookout.

634
38:52.890 --> 38:53.700
There's nothing here.

635
38:53.720 --> 38:54.950
We need to check that room.

636
39:00.880 --> 39:02.070
Find anything, Inspector?

637
39:02.200 --> 39:03.230
I can't find a thing.

638
39:03.720 --> 39:06.500
Gosh, it only takes five minutes to shower.

639
39:06.520 --> 39:07.980
Yeah, I am looking right now!

640
39:26.590 --> 39:28.925
I found it! I think this is it.

641
39:28.950 --> 39:31.410
- Found it. It's a full list of names. - Let me take a look.

642
39:31.840 --> 39:34.060
It's a complete list of everyone involved.

643
39:34.440 --> 39:35.540
Let me see.

644
39:42.230 --> 39:43.220
It's real.

645
39:44.240 --> 39:45.460
He's not getting away this time.

646
39:46.000 --> 39:47.360
We've found the boss.

647
39:48.320 --> 39:49.100
So...

648
39:49.530 --> 39:50.480
I'm pretty good, right?

649
39:50.750 --> 39:52.050
You're amazing, Inspector.

650
39:52.740 --> 39:53.950
How about a reward?

651
39:54.940 --> 39:56.040
What kind of reward?

652
39:57.700 --> 39:58.620
Inspector...

653
39:59.219 --> 40:00.730
You can't do it here.

654
40:02.720 --> 40:03.460
Hey!

655
40:05.420 --> 40:06.460
What the hell are you doing?

656
40:07.870 --> 40:09.440
Why are you messing with my stuff?

657
40:11.980 --> 40:12.970
What's the problem?

658
40:13.130 --> 40:15.820
I was just looking for some oil for your massage.

659
40:16.180 --> 40:17.180
Bullsh*t!

660
40:19.670 --> 40:21.240
You two are cops, aren't you?

661
40:23.730 --> 40:25.310
Sh*t. Damn it.

662
40:25.440 --> 40:26.580
I knew something was off.

663
40:27.620 --> 40:28.920
I've been all over Chiang Mai,

664
40:30.400 --> 40:32.500
but I've never seen anyone like you two.

665
40:34.210 --> 40:36.510
Wait, just take it easy.

666
40:37.220 --> 40:38.860
The thing is, the two of us...

667
40:39.470 --> 40:41.750
just came down from the mountains.

668
40:41.900 --> 40:43.620
Even your accent is wrong.

669
40:44.430 --> 40:45.530
You trying to play me?

670
40:45.890 --> 40:46.510
Are you?

671
40:48.580 --> 40:50.050
You've got some nerve coming into my territory.

672
40:50.680 --> 40:53.020
You are leaving in body bags.

673
40:59.855 --> 41:01.020
You little sh*ts!

674
41:01.780 --> 41:02.890
Sh*t!

675
41:04.640 --> 41:05.265
You bastard!

676
41:05.290 --> 41:05.694
You...

677
41:11.490 --> 41:12.790
I think something's going down inside.

678
41:30.660 --> 41:31.350
F*ck!

679
41:35.640 --> 41:36.490
Let me go!

680
41:51.650 --> 41:52.430
What are you doing?

681
41:52.460 --> 41:53.250
What the hell?

682
41:58.490 --> 41:59.590
Let go of me!

683
42:00.550 --> 42:01.510
Let go of me!

684
42:03.850 --> 42:04.590
Hey!

685
42:05.290 --> 42:06.230
What are you doing?

686
42:30.910 --> 42:31.610
Let's go.

687
42:34.970 --> 42:36.400
You useless bunch of idiots!

688
42:36.790 --> 42:37.990
F*ck you!

689
42:39.150 --> 42:40.330
Hey, let's go!

690
42:50.770 --> 42:51.519
Phuwin, watch out!

691
43:03.340 --> 43:04.190
Come on!

692
43:09.760 --> 43:11.380
Hey, we were just about to leave.

693
43:11.520 --> 43:12.620
Stop with the bullsh*t.

694
43:12.680 --> 43:14.020
I know you're cops.

695
43:14.280 --> 43:15.340
We're not.

696
43:15.840 --> 43:17.120
Watch out, Captain!

697
43:21.810 --> 43:22.650
Are you hurt?

698
43:27.636 --> 43:28.263
Blood...

699
43:33.880 --> 43:35.290
Let go of me!

700
43:35.593 --> 43:36.490
Get down!

701
43:38.720 --> 43:39.740
Let me go!

702
43:42.310 --> 43:43.060
Wait...

703
43:43.750 --> 43:44.400
Hey,

704
43:44.710 --> 43:46.700
your eyebrow is bleeding.

705
43:47.070 --> 43:47.990
Are you alright?

706
43:48.640 --> 43:49.310
I'm fine.

707
43:50.000 --> 43:50.710
It's nothing.

708
43:56.015 --> 43:56.795
Mungkorn...

709
43:56.820 --> 43:57.830
- Are you holding up? - I can't...

710
43:59.750 --> 44:01.660
Damn, it's freaking hot.

711
44:01.990 --> 44:03.140
Hang in there, Inspector.

712
44:18.480 --> 44:20.120
I think the drug is starting to kick in.

713
44:20.680 --> 44:22.150
You might not be able to handle it.

714
44:22.540 --> 44:23.730
I'll be fine.

715
44:23.920 --> 44:26.260
I'll use the effects to my advantage,

716
44:26.870 --> 44:28.520
but you have to help me stay focused.

717
44:52.120 --> 44:53.263
Inspector, watch out!

718
45:20.040 --> 45:20.780
Mungkorn,

719
45:21.380 --> 45:23.596
why are you such a good dancer?

720
45:25.480 --> 45:27.890
Inspector, what on earth are you seeing right now?

721
45:30.030 --> 45:31.060
Kiss me.

722
45:32.050 --> 45:33.180
It'll help clear my head.

723
45:34.720 --> 45:35.510
Inspector!

724
45:37.150 --> 45:37.820
Whoa...

725
45:38.210 --> 45:39.640
Get it together!

726
45:41.770 --> 45:42.790
You want it rough?

727
45:47.400 --> 45:48.360
Inspector!

728
46:45.890 --> 46:47.410
I'll take care of you, Mungkorn.

729
46:47.740 --> 46:48.980
I trust you, Inspector.

730
46:56.750 --> 46:58.380
Can you handle this, Thear?

731
46:58.740 --> 46:59.700
I certainly can.

732
47:20.709 --> 47:21.929
Thear!

733
47:31.250 --> 47:32.110
Inspector!

734
47:33.040 --> 47:33.760
Hey!

735
47:34.800 --> 47:36.336
Inspector, stop!

736
47:38.900 --> 47:40.500
- Stop! Let me go. - Inspector!

737
47:43.320 --> 47:44.420
Hold on...

738
47:45.190 --> 47:46.560
I don't think you can do this anymore.

739
47:47.290 --> 47:49.160
Better let the others handle the rest.

740
47:53.580 --> 47:54.290
Mungkorn...

741
47:56.540 --> 47:57.330
Hey,

742
47:58.100 --> 47:59.560
I'm not holding you back, am I?

743
48:00.580 --> 48:01.550
Not at all.

744
48:03.380 --> 48:04.820
You were amazing, Inspector.

745
48:12.020 --> 48:13.420
Die, you bastards!

746
48:18.350 --> 48:19.020
Hey...

747
48:20.750 --> 48:22.160
You should sit down first.

748
48:22.860 --> 48:23.900
Take it slow.

749
48:24.550 --> 48:26.060
Just stay with me.

750
48:29.890 --> 48:31.490
I'm pressing on the wound. Hang in there.

751
48:34.930 --> 48:37.110
Goddammit, you shot my husband!

752
48:38.150 --> 48:39.640
You raided my hideout.

753
48:40.180 --> 48:40.750
How dare you?

754
48:42.490 --> 48:43.720
You two are a couple, huh?

755
48:45.980 --> 48:47.240
Then you can die together,

756
48:47.380 --> 48:48.120
you bastards!

757
48:53.657 --> 48:55.530
Stop! Goddammit.

758
48:56.770 --> 48:57.480
Mungkorn!

759
48:57.670 --> 48:59.643
- Who the hell are you? - Are you okay, Inspector?

760
48:59.668 --> 49:00.370
What is this?

761
49:00.395 --> 49:02.550
Stay with me, alright?

762
49:02.580 --> 49:04.340
Just breathe. In and out.

763
49:05.530 --> 49:06.760
Are you hurt, Inspector?

764
49:06.780 --> 49:07.535
I'm fine.

765
49:07.560 --> 49:08.720
Listen, I'm pressing on the wound.

766
49:08.890 --> 49:09.780
Mungkorn!

767
49:10.100 --> 49:12.210
Phuwin, call an ambulance now!

768
49:13.360 --> 49:14.395
I'll keep the pressure on.

769
49:14.420 --> 49:15.995
- Hey, round up all the suspects - Stay with me.

770
49:16.020 --> 49:17.660
- and get an ambulance here immediately! - Are you okay?

771
49:17.690 --> 49:18.470
Yes, sir.

772
49:18.490 --> 49:19.350
I'm fine.

773
49:20.370 --> 49:21.270
Stay with me.

774
49:23.650 --> 49:24.430
Mungkorn,

775
49:24.450 --> 49:26.025
you're going to be okay.

776
49:26.050 --> 49:26.820
Stay awake.

777
49:26.840 --> 49:28.600
- I'm okay, Inspector. - Listen.

778
49:28.830 --> 49:30.963
I want some shaved ice.

779
49:31.080 --> 49:32.720
Shaved ice? Of course.

780
49:32.880 --> 49:34.120
I'll make sure you get to eat it.

781
49:34.150 --> 49:35.205
It's my treat.

782
49:35.230 --> 49:36.200
- Promise? - Excuse me,

783
49:36.600 --> 49:37.760
friends aren't allowed inside.

784
49:37.890 --> 49:39.556
I'm not a friend. I'm his husband.

785
49:39.600 --> 49:41.960
Then please wait outside and fill out the patient's information.

786
50:29.670 --> 50:32.540
I, Inspector Thear, solemnly swear...

787
50:32.720 --> 50:36.460
that I will be a good husband to you forever.

788
50:39.610 --> 50:43.063
I promise to be a good husband

789
50:43.780 --> 50:45.720
to share in both joy and sorrow

790
50:46.260 --> 50:48.020
and never leave your side.

791
53:08.240 --> 53:09.600
Mungkorn's going to be okay.

792
53:10.650 --> 53:12.090
Even if he is okay,

793
53:13.120 --> 53:15.320
I'm not letting those bastards get away with this.

794
53:15.810 --> 53:16.940
They freaking hurt Mungkorn.

795
53:17.510 --> 53:18.940
I know you're worried about him,

796
53:19.980 --> 53:21.580
but don't you dare do it alone.

797
53:21.950 --> 53:22.760
Yeah.

798
53:23.660 --> 53:25.560
Everyone here is worried about him.

799
53:25.760 --> 53:27.580
But if you're going, we're going together.

800
53:36.360 --> 53:38.280
I have removed the bullet.

801
53:39.010 --> 53:40.710
The patient is now out of danger,

802
53:41.350 --> 53:43.520
but he'll need some time to recover.

803
53:44.680 --> 53:45.760
I'll take my leave now.

804
53:49.711 --> 53:50.905
- Yes! - Yes!

805
53:50.930 --> 53:53.900
- My bro made it! - My boy's tough as nails.

806
53:54.830 --> 53:56.610
Keep it down, everyone. We're in a hospital.

807
54:02.460 --> 54:03.040
Hey.

808
54:03.810 --> 54:05.190
Mungkorn is safe now.

809
54:05.820 --> 54:07.440
You can stop looking so grim now.

810
54:10.470 --> 54:11.610
Do you guys think...

811
54:12.160 --> 54:13.180
he'd have ended up like this

812
54:13.800 --> 54:14.890
if I'd been better

813
54:15.610 --> 54:16.980
or more careful?

814
54:17.360 --> 54:18.200
Inspector,

815
54:18.800 --> 54:19.960
stop blaming yourself.

816
54:21.180 --> 54:23.390
I'm sure Mungkorn already knew...

817
54:23.800 --> 54:25.000
that being a police officer

818
54:25.360 --> 54:26.750
comes with its fair share of risks.

819
54:27.620 --> 54:28.580
In fact,

820
54:29.240 --> 54:31.260
he might even be happy when he wakes up

821
54:31.980 --> 54:34.010
and realizes you...

822
54:34.710 --> 54:37.170
care about him like you're in love with him.

823
54:42.480 --> 54:43.230
That's true.

824
54:44.080 --> 54:46.950
Mungkorn must be proud of you, too.

825
54:49.120 --> 54:49.860
Yeah.

826
55:06.040 --> 55:07.360
The patient is awake,

827
55:07.390 --> 55:08.910
but he's still a bit dazed

828
55:08.940 --> 55:10.750
and confused from the effects of the medication.

829
55:10.860 --> 55:13.110
I suggest visitors go in one at a time.

830
55:13.280 --> 55:14.690
Okay, I'll go first.

831
55:14.710 --> 55:15.420
Right this way.

832
55:17.430 --> 55:18.495
I can go in now, right?

833
55:18.520 --> 55:19.370
- Yes. - Yes.

834
55:32.320 --> 55:34.020
He's still groggy from the anesthesia.

835
55:34.340 --> 55:35.910
His condition is stable for now.

836
55:37.860 --> 55:38.410
Okay.

837
55:39.280 --> 55:40.290
Hey...

838
55:41.820 --> 55:43.670
What happened to me?

839
55:44.640 --> 55:45.780
You just had surgery.

840
55:46.380 --> 55:47.640
You were shot.

841
55:50.320 --> 55:51.810
I was shot?

842
55:53.990 --> 55:55.910
Did it hit my heart?

843
55:57.233 --> 55:59.090
Where is my heart?

844
55:59.660 --> 56:01.120
Your heart is still there.

845
56:05.730 --> 56:06.740
Where is it?

846
56:11.640 --> 56:12.570
Right here.

847
56:16.170 --> 56:17.430
Your heart is right here.

848
56:20.660 --> 56:22.230
I'll take my leave now.

849
56:23.100 --> 56:24.160
Thank you very much.

850
56:31.000 --> 56:32.650
It really is here.

851
56:34.420 --> 56:35.860
It's beating so fast.

852
56:44.370 --> 56:45.730
Who are you?

853
56:55.320 --> 56:56.910
Why are you so handsome?

854
57:04.270 --> 57:05.540
My name is Thear.

855
57:07.300 --> 57:08.410
Inspector Thear.

856
57:09.170 --> 57:10.600
- Thear... - Do you remember me?

857
57:14.090 --> 57:16.540
I think I've seen you before.

858
57:19.090 --> 57:19.970
Really?

859
57:20.764 --> 57:22.050
Where did you see me?

860
57:24.250 --> 57:25.720
In my sleep...

861
57:27.640 --> 57:30.380
I dream about you all the time.

862
57:33.580 --> 57:35.530
Does that mean I'm...

863
57:37.780 --> 57:40.630
so handsome that you dream about me?

864
57:44.140 --> 57:45.080
Oh...

865
57:52.060 --> 57:53.510
But I think...

866
57:55.340 --> 57:57.490
I like you.

867
58:06.930 --> 58:08.870
I like you, too.

868
58:10.340 --> 58:11.630
When I dream,

869
58:13.370 --> 58:15.040
I only dream about you, Mungkorn.

870
58:17.000 --> 58:18.380
Mungkorn?

871
58:20.820 --> 58:22.780
Is my name Mungkorn?

872
58:24.270 --> 58:25.210
Yeah.

873
58:26.120 --> 58:27.750
Your name is Mungkorn,

874
58:29.150 --> 58:31.450
and you are the love of my life.

875
58:34.760 --> 58:35.870
The love of your life?

876
58:38.590 --> 58:39.900
Does that mean...

877
58:41.530 --> 58:44.360
I'm your love, Inspector Thear?

878
58:44.470 --> 58:49.150
♪That level of cuteness is against the law♪

879
58:49.390 --> 58:54.050
♪I must be under your spell, can I blame you at all?♪

880
58:54.250 --> 58:56.830
♪You're guilty of messing with my heart,♪

881
58:56.860 --> 58:59.170
♪Stirring up my feelings right from the start,♪

882
58:59.190 --> 59:02.110
♪The fine you'll pay is your whole heart♪

883
59:02.510 --> 59:06.530
♪You take the blame, I'll take the love part♪

884
59:12.370 --> 59:16.380
♪You take the blame, I'll take the love part♪

885
59:21.492 --> 59:23.038
- From this day forward, - From this day forward...

886
59:23.063 --> 59:26.432
may there be no more hardship or harm in our lives.

887
59:26.485 --> 59:30.358
And may we live happily for many years to come.

888
59:30.865 --> 59:32.396
Ever since we got married,

889
59:32.978 --> 59:34.760
my luck has gone downhill.

890
59:35.186 --> 59:37.330
Looks like your bad luck finally wore off.

891
59:37.822 --> 59:38.957
I'm the one stuck with it now.

892
59:44.000 --> 59:46.430
♪When you smile♪

893
59:46.450 --> 59:48.890
♪And you look into my eyes,♪

894
59:48.920 --> 59:53.230
♪It's too much for this heart to keep inside♪

895
59:53.820 --> 59:56.220
♪Almost forgot how to breathe,♪

896
59:56.240 --> 59:58.700
♪How could you do this to me?♪

897
59:58.730 --> 01:00:04.300
♪Told you to stop, but you wouldn't agree♪

898
01:00:04.760 --> 01:00:07.270
♪With all the evidence I have found,♪

899
01:00:07.300 --> 01:00:11.180
♪Guess I'll have to take you into custody now♪

900
01:00:11.200 --> 01:00:16.000
♪That level of cuteness is against the law♪

901
01:00:16.030 --> 01:00:20.640
♪I must be under your spell, can I blame you at all?♪

902
01:00:21.010 --> 01:00:23.590
♪You're guilty of messing with my heart,♪

903
01:00:23.620 --> 01:00:25.930
♪Stirring up my feelings right from the start,♪

904
01:00:25.950 --> 01:00:28.870
♪The fine you'll pay is your whole heart♪

905
01:00:29.250 --> 01:00:33.930
♪You take the blame, I'll take the love part♪
